## 6. Penegakan Otomatis di CI/CD

| Pemeriksaan | Alat | Tindakan Jika Gagal |
|-------------|------|---------------------|
| Query tanpa filter `tenant_id` | Custom ESLint rule | Build ditolak |
| Penggunaan `any` type | `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any` | Build ditolak |
| Tabel baru tanpa RLS | Skrip CI `check-rls.sh` | Build ditolak |
| Kerentanan dependensi | `npm audit --audit-level=high` | Build ditolak |
| SAST (analisis statis keamanan) | Semgrep | Peringatan pada PR |
| Secret leak detection | GitLeaks | Build ditolak |

